  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Prefer generate/validate/stats on trusted JSON. Outputs use USECVISLIB_MCP_OUTPUT_DIR (default: user-scoped temp). Use a dedicated directory; cleanup deletes files older than one hour. Set USECVISLIB_MCP_OUTPUT_TTL_SECONDS=0 to disable cleanup.",
    "Put analyze_binary_* and get_binary_stats on Review: they read a host file path (scoped by USECVISLIB_MCP_ALLOWED_INPUT_DIRS when set).",
    "Review batch_process, export_data, generate_report and export_maestro: they touch more files or produce larger artifacts than a single render.",
    "Install from https://github.com/vulnex/usecvislib-mcp (Apache-2.0) and launch the usecvislib-mcp console script; pin a release tag before enabling."
